  "preamble": "Voicing of the voiceless alveolo-palatal fricative [ɕ] to [ʑ] by regressive voicing assimilation. In Polish an obstruent cluster takes the voicing of its last obstruent, so stem-final ś [ɕ] (from s before the -i- of the verb stem) is voiced to [ʑ] before the voiced stop of the suffix -ba: prosić 'to ask' gives prośba [ˈprɔʑba] 'request' and kosić 'to mow' gives kośba [ˈkɔʑba] 'mowing'. The same ś stays voiceless word-finally, as in the imperative proś [prɔɕ].",
  "phoneticEffects": "Voicing, Voicing Assimilation",
